/-- **(6.22)** ([DIR], proof of Proposition 6.8). $g_{LJ}(\frac14,\frac34)\ge0.02$. -/
theorem eqn_6_22 : g_LJ 4⁻¹ (3 / 4) ≥ 0.02 := by
