/-- [DIR], proof of Proposition 6.8:
$$\partial_y^2(g_{LJ}(1-y,y))=(\sqrt2-1)J''(y)+L_{\frac12}''(1-y)\le0$$
(for $y\in[\frac34,1)$). -/
theorem g_LJ_diag_deriv2 (y : ℝ) (hy : y ∈ Ico (3 / 4 : ℝ) 1) :
